## 8. main.js — 生命周期编排

```text
帮我在 js/main.js 写完整入口:

import { createNewGame, prepareQuarter, selectDecision, applyMetricsDelta,
         applyDirectorOutput, applyPressResult, checkDeath, advanceQuarter,
         METRIC_KEYS, METRIC_LABELS, TOTAL_QUARTERS } from './state.js';
import { runDirector } from './director.js';
import { evaluatePress } from './press.js';
import { isLLMConfigured } from './llm.js';
import * as ui from './ui.js';

启动流程:
1. DOMContentLoaded → if !isLLMConfigured() → ui.renderOnboarding(onConfigured: startNewGame)
2. else → startNewGame()

startNewGame():
  state = createNewGame()
  prepareQuarter(state)
  ui.renderHUD(state)
  ui.renderBriefing(state.thisQuarter.briefing)
  ui.renderGossip(state.thisQuarter.gossip)
  ui.renderDecisionCards(state.thisQuarter.decisionCards, onCardPick)

onCardPick(cardId):
  selectDecision(state, cardId)
  applyMetricsDelta(state, card.immediateEffect)
  ui.updateHUD(state)
  ui.lockCards()
  if state.thisQuarter.pressType:
    transcript = await ui.openPressPanel(state)
    pressResult = await evaluatePress(state, transcript)
    applyPressResult(state, pressResult, transcript)
    ui.renderPressResult(pressResult)
  directorOut = await runDirector(state, card)
  applyDirectorOutput(state, directorOut)
  ui.renderSettlement(state.thisQuarter.settlement)
  ui.updateHUD(state)
  await ui.waitNextClick()
  death = checkDeath(state)
  if death:
    ui.renderDeathReport(state)
  else:
    advanceQuarter(state)
    if state.status === 'won':
      ui.renderVictory(state)
    else:
      prepareQuarter(state)
      ui.renderQuarter(state)

错误处理:
- 任何 await 抛错 → ui.renderToast(err.message) + 不推进 state
- LLM 失联用 stub 已经在 director/press 里兜底了,UI 显示 [AI 失联] 标识
- 用户切 tab 不暂停(纯回合制无所谓)

约束:
- 全部异步用 async/await,不要 .then 嵌套
- 不引入状态管理库,直接闭包持有 state 引用
- 所有 ui.* 调用是 idempotent
```

